  "description": "Kang Hae-Yeong is a die-hard anti-fan of Lee Hyeon, the lead singer of a popular band. He spends his days following Lee Hyeon’s every move and picking fights with him—a truly pathetic existence. Then one day, he finds himself drawn to a stranger with a voice similar to Lee Hyeon’s and ends up having a one-night stand with him... But this guy... now that he looks at him, it’s not just his voice that’s similar—he’s Lee Hyeon himself, isn’t he?!\n\n*“If you were going to write something like that... you should at least tell me if you really hated me that much.”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
